    Component {
      Type          Subsystem
      Name          "Flux-vector control"
      Show          on
      Position      [250, 100]
      Direction     up
      Flipped       off
      LabelPosition south
      Frame         [-50, -30; 50, 30]
      SampleTime    "-1"
      CodeGenDiscretizationMethod "2"
      CodeGenTarget "Generic"
      MaskType      "VectorControlSystem (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Speed control of a synchronous machine drive with flux-vector control (VectorControlSystem with FluxVectorController and SpeedController). Each class of motulator is a block with a mask of its arguments. The top-level blocks refer to the variables of the model initialization, and the blocks inside them get their parameters as in the constructors of motulator. T_s is the sampling period of the measurements. While the input enable is not positive, the duty ratios are 0.5 and the state is reset to its initial value."
      MaskIconFrame on
      MaskIconOpaque off
      MaskIconRotates on
      Parameter {
        Variable      "T_s"
        Prompt        "T_s: Sampling period (s)"
        Type          FreeText
        Value         "cfg.T_s"
        Show          off
        Tunable       on
        TabName       "VectorControlSystem"
      }
      Terminal {
